<title>POLAND: All Polish min T-bill prices rise on huge demand.</title>
<headline>All Polish min T-bill prices rise on huge demand.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minimum prices of all Polish T-bills rose at today's primary auction on total demand of 4.66 billion zlotys against a 1.3 billion zloty offer, the finance ministry said.  </p>
<p>   T-bill	   8-week  13-week  26-week   39-week 52-week</p>
<p>   new min price   96.76    94.78    90.11     ---     82.01</p>
<p>    (pvs auction) (96.75)  (94.75)  (90.03)    ---    (81.85)</p>
<p>   new max price   97.21    94.95    90.50     ---     82.04</p>
<p>   (pvs auction)  (96.90)  (95.28)  (90.07)    ---    (81.90)</p>
<p>   offer	     200.0    300.0    200.0     ---     600.0</p>
<p>   bids recorded   757.1    606.2    692.2     ---   2,582.9</p>
<p>   bids accepted   323.9    300.0    200.0     ---     600.0</p>
<p>   next auction    200.0    300.0    200.0     ---     600.0</p>
<p>NOTE. Offer and all bids in million zlotys.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
